                        <summary>This inscription records the construction of the tank, Ācabbe-samudra named after Ācabbe, the daughter of Aṇuṁgu Duggarayya, during the reign of Taila II,and the donations made for the tank by the <foreign>dādi</foreign> or nursemaid(?) of Iṟiva-beḍaṁga Satyāśraya. 
                            
